    "## 4. Experiment A: Stepwise Feature Ablation (Table 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "ประเมินผลการเพิ่มฟีเจอร์ทีละลำดับชั้น (Feature Accumulation Layer) บนชุดทดสอบ $N = 1,148$ แมตช์โดยใช้ L2 Logistic Regression ($C = 5.0, \\lambda = 0.20$):\n",
    "- **Majority Baseline (Test):** Always Blue (586 / 1,148, 51.05%)\n",
    "- **Majority Baseline (Train):** Always Red (562 / 1,148, 48.95%)\n",
    "- **Config 0:** One-Hot Linear Baseline (127 features, 581 / 1,148, 50.61%)\n",
    "- **Config 1:** + Individual Win Rate $F_{\\text{ind}}$ (613 / 1,148, 53.40%)\n",
    "- **Config 2:** + Pairwise Teammate Synergy $F_{\\text{syn}}$ (615 / 1,148, 53.57%)\n",
    "- **Config 3:** + Head-to-Head Counter-Picks $F_{\\text{ctr}}$ (625 / 1,148, 54.44%)\n",
    "- **Config 4 (Full):** Full Relational Matrix + $F_{\\text{tier}}$ (627 / 1,148, 54.62%)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =====================================================================\n",
    "# Step 3: Reproduce Table 2 (Stepwise Feature Ablation)\n",
    "# =====================================================================\n",
    "table2_rows = []\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Majority Baseline (Always Blue)\n",
    "p_blue = np.ones(len(y_test))\n",
    "prob_blue = np.full(len(y_test), test_blue_wins / len(y_test))\n",
    "r_maj_test = evaluate_predictions(y_test, p_blue, prob_blue)\n",
    "table2_rows.append({\n",
    "    \"Configuration\": \"Majority Baseline (Test)\",\n",
    "    \"Feature Accumulation Layer\": \"Zero Information (Always Blue)\",\n",
