    "## 6. McNemar's Paired Statistical Hypothesis Tests\n",
    "\n",
    "ทดสอบนัยสำคัญทางสถิติแบบคู่ (Paired McNemar's Test with Continuity Correction) ตามที่รายงานใน Section 6.1:\n",
    "1. **Relational Logistic Regression (53.92%) vs One-Hot Logistic Regression (50.61%):**\n",
    "   - $b = 123$ (Relational ทายถูก แต่ One-Hot ทายผิด)\n",
    "   - $c = 95$ (One-Hot ทายถูก แต่ Relational ทายผิด)\n",
    "   - $\\chi^2 = \\frac{(|123 - 95| - 1)^2}{123 + 95} = \\frac{729}{218} \\approx 3.344, \\quad p = 0.067$\n",
    "2. **GBDT (54.79%) vs Always Blue Majority Baseline (51.05%):**\n",
    "   - $b = 304$ (GBDT ทายถูก แต่ Always Blue ทายผิด)\n",
    "   - $c = 261$ (Always Blue ทายถูก แต่ GBDT ทายผิด)\n",
    "   - $\\chi^2 = \\frac{(|304 - 261| - 1)^2}{304 + 261} = \\frac{1,764}{565} \\approx 3.122, \\quad p = 0.077$"
   ]
